 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.1667,
   "text": "In this town, you could not be a pirate until you were eighteen."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.why",
   "start": 3.1667,
   "end": 5.5667,
   "text": "A boat that went past the last buoy did not come back."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.map",
   "start": 5.5667,
   "end": 8.1667,
   "text": "I found a map when I was small, and I could not put it down."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.x",
   "start": 8.1667,
   "end": 11.5,
   "text": "The X was past that buoy. I looked at it every single day."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.door",
   "start": 11.5,
   "end": 15.0,
   "text": "So I built a boat out of a door. It sank in the pond."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.laugh",
   "start": 15.0,
   "end": 17.6333,
   "text": "The whole town laughed. So I waited."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.lock",
   "start": 17.6333,
   "end": 20.9667,
   "text": "Every year I put a hand on the chain. Every year it held."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.key",
   "start": 20.9667,
   "end": 24.0333,
   "text": "The morning I turned eighteen, my dad put the key in my hand."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.crew",
   "start": 24.0333,
   "end": 26.3333,
   "text": "I asked two villagers and one player to come with me."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.hat",
   "start": 26.3333,
   "end": 28.7667,
   "text": "The one in the straw hat said yes before I had finished."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.bow",
   "start": 28.7667,
   "end": 31.0,
   "text": "The one with the bow said yes, and brought a lantern."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.player",
   "start": 31.0,
   "end": 32.9333,
   "text": "The player said yes, and brought a rope."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.food",
   "start": 32.9333,
   "end": 34.4,
   "text": "We put the food in a chest."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.water",
   "start": 34.4,
   "end": 36.0,
   "text": "We put the water in beside it."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.ball",
   "start": 36.0,
   "end": 38.2,
   "text": "The ball went in last. It was red."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.mum",
   "start": 38.2,
   "end": 41.3333,
   "text": "My mum stood on the dock. She would not let go of my sleeve."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.dad",
   "start": 41.3333,
   "end": 44.2667,
   "text": "My dad smiled. \"He'll be fine,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.sail",
   "start": 44.2667,
   "end": 46.7333,
   "text": "So we sailed. The town got small behind us."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.buoy",
   "start": 46.7333,
   "end": 49.4333,
   "text": "The last buoy went by. I did not look back."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.day",
   "start": 49.4333,
   "end": 51.8667,
   "text": "The sun sat on the water. I held the map up to it."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.night",
   "start": 51.8667,
   "end": 54.4333,
   "text": "Then the sun went down, and we hung the lantern on the mast."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.up",
   "start": 54.4333,
   "end": 57.5,
   "text": "The sun came up. The X was closer. I checked it twice."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.down",
   "start": 57.5,
   "end": 61.0,
   "text": "The sun went down again. No land. Just us, and the map."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.bored",
   "start": 61.0,
   "end": 64.6,
   "text": "They were bored. I was not. The map was still in my hands."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.down",
   "start": 64.6,
   "end": 67.7,
   "text": "The one in the straw hat went down the ladder, under the floor of the boat."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.chest",
   "start": 67.7,
   "end": 70.0333,
   "text": "He opened the chest, and he came up with the ball."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.play",
   "start": 70.0333,
   "end": 72.5667,
   "text": "The three of them played on the deck. I did not look up."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.us",
   "start": 72.5667,
   "end": 74.1,
   "text": "\"Play with us,\" they said."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.slip",
   "start": 74.1,
   "end": 77.0333,
   "text": "The ball hit the rail, and it went down into the water."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.jump",
   "start": 77.0333,
   "end": 79.0,
   "text": "The one in the straw hat jumped in after it."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.watch",
   "start": 79.0,
   "end": 81.8,
   "text": "The rest of us turned to watch. Our backs were to the sea."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.got",
   "start": 81.8,
   "end": 85.6667,
   "text": "He got the ball. He held it up. And then he stopped laughing."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.past",
   "start": 85.6667,
   "end": 86.9,
   "text": "He was looking past us."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.slow",
   "start": 86.9,
   "end": 89.1667,
   "text": "So we turned around. Slowly."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.dark",
   "start": 89.1667,
   "end": 91.0333,
   "text": "The water behind the boat had gone dark."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.big",
   "start": 91.0333,
   "end": 93.7667,
   "text": "A shadow sat on it. The shadow was bigger than the boat."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.arm",
   "start": 93.7667,
   "end": 95.9667,
   "text": "An arm came up out of the shadow. Then another."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.more",
   "start": 95.9667,
   "end": 97.5,
   "text": "Then more arms than I could count."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.kraken",
   "start": 97.5,
   "end": 100.7667,
   "text": "It was a kraken. An octopus, as wide as our town."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.night",
   "start": 100.7667,
   "end": 103.5,
   "text": "And it was night. The lantern was the only light it had."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.end",
   "start": 103.5,
   "end": 104.7,
   "text": "To be continued."
  }
 ],
